1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
This is QuestLog.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,000
Every minute you don't spend on Instagram
or TikTok earns you something.

3
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,000
XP, gold, daily quests,

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,000
and a streak that multiplies it all.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Gold builds your city.

6
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,000
The less you scroll, the more it grows.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Sometimes you do need the app.
So say why.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,500
A small AI model checks
if it's a real task —

9
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:40,000
and if it is, those five minutes
don't count against you.

10
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,000
Just bored? It'll tell you —
and still let you in.

11
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,000
No lectures, just honesty.

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Free players get one mindful unlock a day.

13
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:56,500
Pro makes it unlimited, with a free trial
that shows up right when you've earned it:

14
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:00,000
your first seven-day streak.

15
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Progress shows the long game —

16
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:12,000
everything you've taken back.

17
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:18,000
And when you're proud of it,

18
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:24,000
share your skyline.

19
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:30,000
QuestLog.
Less scrolling, more building.
